  "description": "Ideal for getting out and finding adventure, the Dumont folds into a compact 45.25\" x 32.5\" x 25\" size for easy transport.\n\nFor comfort and performance, the Dumont's seat can be adjusted between 42 and 49 degrees.\n\nThe Dumont's rear suspension features a highly progressive travel path combined with a custom spring rate and sophisticated damping for a perfect balance of performance and comfort. Up front, the Dumont uses our patented anti-dive suspension spindles to take the edge off.\n\nThe fully suspended Dumont integrates a rear suspension system for a smooth ride, featuring a progressive travel path and custom spring rate with sophisticated damping. Its CNC-machined swingarm pivots on precision cartridge bearings for durability. Catrike’s patented anti-dive front suspension enhances stability, allowing independent movement of all wheels. With a 26-inch rear wheel and folding capability, the Dumont offers performance, comfort and a folding feature for easy transport and storage.",
